{"article": "The article in question is a scholarly work that discusses the development and validation of a method to improve posttransplant survival rates and reduce adverse outcomes in liver transplants. It introduces a compatibility score called _DisCScore_ and utilizes a multi-label variant of XGBoost with a survival loss function named _DiscSurvBoost_.|Here is another description: The subject, \"article,\" refers to a scholarly or scientific publication that presents research findings, methodologies, and conclusions. In this context, the article is authored by specific individuals and is subject to certain licensing terms.|Here is another description: The article in question is a scholarly work that discusses the development and validation of a method for improving posttransplant survival rates and reducing adverse outcomes in liver transplants. It introduces a novel compatibility score, _DisCScore_, which is derived using a specialized machine learning model."},
