{"article__is_licensed_under__creative_commons_attribution_cc_by_4_0_international_license": "The predicate, \"is licensed under,\" indicates the legal framework under which the article is distributed and used. This licensing term specifies the permissions and restrictions associated with the article's use, ensuring proper attribution and compliance with the designated license."},
{"creative_commons_attribution_cc_by_4_0_international_license": "The object, \"Creative Commons Attribution (CC BY 4.0) International license,\" is a standard license that allows others to distribute, remix, adapt, and build upon the article, even commercially, as long as they give appropriate credit to the original author(s) and cite the license. This license promotes the free distribution of knowledge while ensuring that the original creators are acknowledged."},
