{"https_creativecommons_org_licenses_by_4_0_legalcode": "The object, \"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode,\" is the web address that leads to the legal code of the Creative Commons Attribution (CC BY 4.0) International license. This URL contains the full text of the license, outlining the specific permissions and requirements for using the licensed work."},
