{"the_donor_feature_vector": "The donor feature vector is a set of characteristics or attributes associated with a donor in the allocation problem. It is combined with the recipient feature vector to form the concatenated feature vector **x** _i_, which is used to determine the optimal scoring function for post-transplant survival."},
