{"survival_probabilities_at_a_series_of_discrete_time_points": "Survival probabilities at a series of discrete time points refer to the likelihood of a patient surviving beyond specific intervals post-transplant. These probabilities are critical for assessing patient prognosis and are calculated at multiple time points to offer a comprehensive view of survival chances over time."},
