{"a_setting": "A setting, in this context, refers to the specific configuration or condition associated with each time point _tj_ in the discretized time axis, which is used to analyze the observed survival times and censorship in the study."},
{"yi_j": "_yi,j_ represents a variable or a value in a mathematical or logical expression, specifically within a conditional context.|Here is another description: Yi,j represents the discretized values resulting from the process described. These values are the output of discretizing each outcome, and they are organized in a structured format, likely in a matrix or table, where i and j are indices indicating the position of the discretized value.|Here is another description: Yi,j represents a discretized outcome in a given context, specifically derived from certain parameters."},
