{"star_files": "STAR files are a standardized dataset used in the context of organ transplantation research. They are specifically designed to compile and organize patient-level data related to liver transplant (LT) procedures."},
{"star_files__are__datasets_containing_optn_patient_level_information_about_lt_procedures": "The predicate \"are\" serves as a linking verb in this context, connecting the subject (STAR files) to their definition or description (datasets containing OPTN patient-level information about LT procedures)."},
{"datasets_containing_optn_patient_level_information_about_lt_procedures": "Datasets containing OPTN patient-level information about LT procedures refer to comprehensive collections of data that include detailed records about liver transplant patients. These datasets are sourced from the Organ Procurement and Transplantation Network (OPTN) and encompass both donor and recipient characteristics."},
