{"all_liver_transplants_performed_from_january_2009_to_december_2019": "All liver transplants performed from January 2009 to December 2019 represent a dataset containing detailed patient-level information from U.S. transplant hospitals. This dataset includes both donor and recipient features, collated from UNOS, and is used to ensure the study\u2019s relevance and comprehensiveness."},
