{"time_frame__chosen_to__reflect_today_s_reality_and_provide_a_long_enough_post_transplant_period_to_observe_survival_outcomes": "The predicate \"chosen to\" indicates the deliberate selection of the time frame with specific objectives in mind. It signifies that the time period was not randomly picked but was intentionally chosen to meet certain criteria."},
