{"model__trained_and_tested__on_the_identical_train_test_split": "The predicate 'trained and tested' describes the process undergone by the XGBoost model. It involves using a dataset to both train the model to learn patterns and test its predictive accuracy, ensuring that the model's performance is evaluated under conditions similar to those in which it was trained."},
