{"xgboost__has__inherent_transparency_and_interpretability": "The phrase \"has\" in this context signifies that XGBoost possesses or is characterized by certain qualities. It indicates an inherent attribute or capability that XGBoost inherently includes within its framework."},
{"inherent_transparency_and_interpretability": "Inherent transparency and interpretability refer to the qualities of XGBoost that allow users to understand and interpret the model's decision-making process. This means that the features and logic used by XGBoost to make predictions are clear and can be easily understood by practitioners, which is crucial in fields like medicine where trust and credibility are paramount."},
{"top_20_most_frequently_selected_features": "The top 20 most frequently selected features refer to the most commonly chosen attributes or variables by the _DiscSurvBoost_ model in its analysis. These features are critical as they closely align with the clinical variables considered by practitioners in making transplant decisions."},
