{"d_meld__purpose__optimization_of_donor_recipient_matching": "The purpose of D-MELD is to serve as a straightforward predictor that helps optimize the matching process between donors and recipients in liver transplantation. By providing a clear metric for assessing risk, it aims to improve patient outcomes and resource utilization in transplant procedures."},
