{"regression_models_and_life_tables__publication_year__1972": "The predicate \"publication_year\" indicates the year in which the subject, in this case, the paper \"Regression models and life-tables,\" was officially published in a journal. This information is crucial for understanding the historical context and the evolution of ideas within a field."},
