{"unos_liver_transplants": "UNOS liver transplants refer to the comprehensive dataset of liver transplant procedures recorded by the United Network for Organ Sharing (UNOS), a critical organization in the United States for managing and overseeing organ transplantation. This dataset includes detailed information on various types of liver transplants, which may be filtered to create specific cohorts for research, analysis, and improving transplant outcomes."},
