{"out_of_window_procedures": "Out-of-window procedures refer to liver transplants that were excluded from the study due to not meeting certain criteria within the specified time frame.|Here is another description: Out-of-window procedures refer to liver transplant operations that occurred outside the specified time frame of 2009\u20132019, which were not included in the study cohort."},
