{"out_of_window_procedures__exclusion_from__unos_liver_transplants": "Exclusion from indicates that certain procedures were not included in the dataset of UNOS liver transplants for the purpose of the study, due to them falling outside the predefined criteria or time window."},
{"paediatric_cases": "Paediatric cases refer to liver transplant procedures performed on children within the UNOS database. These cases are specifically categorized based on the age of the recipients."},
