{"60_649": "60,649 is the final count of eligible adult liver transplants remaining after various exclusions, such as out-of-window procedures, pediatric cases, living-donor transplants, multiorgan transplants, temporarily inactive cases, and missing-survival cases. This number represents the transplants available for train/validation/test split in the study."},
