{"creative_commons_attribution_cc_by_4_0_international_license": "The object, \"Creative Commons Attribution (CC BY 4.0) International license,\" is a type of open license that allows the free distribution, remixing, and building upon the work, even commercially, as long as appropriate credit is given to the original author(s). This license facilitates the sharing and adaptation of the article while ensuring proper attribution."},
