{"tree_structure_with_gradient_boosting": "The object \"tree structure with gradient boosting\" describes the two core components integrated within XGBoost. The tree structure refers to the decision trees used for making predictions, while gradient boosting is a method that builds trees sequentially, with each new tree attempting to correct the errors of the previous one, leading to improved overall performance."},
