{"our_score": "Our score refers to a specific metric or evaluation system used to assess performance or outcomes, particularly in the context of filtering out suboptimal donors and predicting survival outcomes over time.|Here is another description: Our score refers to a metric or evaluation system developed to assess and predict outcomes, specifically in the context of filtering out suboptimal donors. It is designed to provide a more accurate and reliable measure compared to other benchmarks.|Here is another description: Our score refers to a metric or evaluation system used to assess the performance or outcomes of a particular process or model, in this case, related to filtering out suboptimal donors and predicting survival outcomes."},
