{"our_model__is__robust_in_predicting_survival_outcomes_over_time": "The predicate \"is\" serves as a linking verb in this context, connecting the subject (our model) with its characteristic or attribute (robust in predicting survival outcomes over time). It asserts the inherent quality or capability of the model."},
